{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47531","headline":"七言 四十 · 吕岩","name":"七言 四十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铁镜烹金火满空，碧潭龙卧夕阳中。\n麒麟意合乾坤地，獬豸机关日月东。\n三尺剑横双水岸，五丁冠顶百神宫。\n闲铺羽服居仙窟，自着金莲造化功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}